,{"className":"small-caps text-[0.72rem] text-vermilion tracking-[0.24em]","children":"I"}],["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-display font-light text-ink text-[clamp(3rem,9vw,7rem)] leading-[0.95] tracking-[-0.02em]","children":"Nunggbi, 2024"}],["$","hr",null,{"className":"hairline-vermilion w-24"}]]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-[1.125rem] text-ink-700 leading-[1.7]","children":"We arrived at the potters' village on a Thursday afternoon. The kilns were cool; the last firing had been on Monday. Ashem Chumthing showed us a kettle he had made from a stone quarried by his cousin. He asked, quietly, whether it was true that his kettles were being sold in Delhi for four times what he received."}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-[1.125rem] text-ink-700 leading-[1.7]","children":["We drove back to Imphal that night. By the following weekend, we had a spreadsheet with three columns: ",["$","em",null,{"children":"artisan"}],", ",["$","em",null,{"children":"village"}],", ",["$","em",null,{"children":"share"}],". That spreadsheet is now this shop."]}]]}]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"py-24 md:py-40","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"mx-auto w-full px-5 md:px-12 lg:px-16 xl:px-[88px] max-w-[780px]","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"flex flex-col gap-8 items-stretch","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"flex flex-col gap-5 items-start text-left","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"small-caps text-[0.72rem] text-vermilion tracking-[0.24em]","children":"II"}],["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-display font-light text-ink text-[clamp(3rem,9vw,7rem)] leading-[0.95] tracking-[-0.02em]","children":"Two rules"}],["$","hr",null,{"className":"hairline-vermilion w-24"}]]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-[1.125rem] text-ink-700 leading-[1.7]","children":"We agreed on two rules at the start. First: never sell a piece without naming its maker. Second: never take a margin the guild does not know about. Every product page publishes both — the maker on 